---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import mediCheckImage from '../../images/Medi_main_window.png';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="YuShan Hung | Software Developer"
  description="YuShan Hung is a software developer with experience across IT operations, data reporting, workflow analysis, and automation."
>
  <section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Software · Systems · Practical problem-solving</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">Software Developer</h1>
      <p class="hero-summary">
        I build practical software and approach technical problems with experience spanning IT
        operations, data reporting, workflow analysis, and automation.
      </p>
      <nav id="contact" class="hero-contact" aria-label="Contact links">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/haneyoshi">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yushan-hung-266273212/">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:pokemonbotno001@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about container" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="section-label">01 / Profile</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
      <p class="about-introduction">
        I am a software developer with a Bachelor’s degree in Applied Computer Science, currently
        working as an IT Operations Analyst. My work and projects have developed my interest in
        the connection between software, data, systems, and the day-to-day workflows they support.
      </p>
      <div class="about-supporting">
        <p>
          I enjoy breaking down technical problems, organizing requirements, and turning ideas into
          practical implementations. My experience includes IT operations, data reporting, workflow
          analysis, automation, and application development. I am continuing to strengthen my
          full-stack development skills through focused projects and the rebuild of this portfolio.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am interested in junior-level and related opportunities where I can contribute careful
          analysis, dependable technical work, and a willingness to keep learning across software
          and systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="projects container" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
    <div class="projects-heading">
      <p class="section-label">02 / Selected work</p>
      <h2 id="projects-title">Projects</h2>
      <p class="projects-introduction">
        These projects show how I approach software development through practical problem
        definition, structured data, interface design, and iterative implementation. Each project
        is presented according to its current scope and maturity, without overstating completion or
        real-world use.
      </p>
    </div>

    <article id="medicheck" class="medicheck" aria-labelledby="medicheck-title">
      <header class="medicheck-header">
        <h3 id="medicheck-title">MediCheck</h3>
        <p class="project-metadata">
          Educational desktop software prototype <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Solo project
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 2024
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="medicheck-summary">
        <p>
          MediCheck is a solo Python and MySQL desktop application created in 2024 as an educational
          software prototype focused on clinic workflow management, relational database design, and
          SQL-based information retrieval across related historical records.
        </p>
        <p class="project-technology"><strong>Technology:</strong> Python, MySQL</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="medicheck-figure">
        <Image
          src={mediCheckImage}
          alt="MediCheck desktop prototype showing a Patient ID field and controls for check-in, queue review, visit history, and patient profile retrieval."
          width={700}
          height={700}
          sizes="(max-width: 48rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), 700px"
          format="png"
        />
        <figcaption>
          MediCheck’s desktop interface groups patient check-in, queue, visit-history, and
          profile-retrieval workflows in one prototype window.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="medicheck-details">
        <section aria-labelledby="medicheck-approach-title">
          <h4 id="medicheck-approach-title">Problem and approach</h4>
          <p>
            The project’s main technical challenge was translating connected historical patient,
            symptom, diagnosis, and medication information into a structured relational model and
            usable desktop workflows for storing, retrieving, and reviewing that information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="medicheck-data-title">
          <h4 id="medicheck-data-title">Relational data and SQL</h4>
          <p>
            I worked across the Python application logic, desktop interface, MySQL schema, database
            connection, sample-data generation, and SQL queries across related records.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <a class="action action-primary medicheck-action" href="https://github.com/haneyoshi/MediCheck">
        View MediCheck on GitHub
      </a>
    </article>

    <article id="echotask" class="echotask" aria-labelledby="echotask-title">
      <header>
        <h3 id="echotask-title">EchoTask</h3>
        <p class="project-metadata">
          Full-stack MVP <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Solo project
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Work in progress
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="echotask-content">
        <p>
          EchoTask is a solo full-stack MVP exploring how an operations team could coordinate
          attendance, work locations, snow logs, and supply requests through a shared web
          application.
        </p>
        <p>
          I designed relational models for buildings, work areas, users, attendance, snow logs, and
          supply requests. The current implementation also includes selected Flask routes and a
          React prototype for searching supplies, selecting quantities, and reviewing a request
          summary.
        </p>
        <p>
          The project demonstrates how I translate operational workflows into relational data
          structures, backend responsibilities, and frontend interactions.
        </p>
        <p class="project-technology">
          <strong>Technology:</strong> React, Flask, SQLAlchemy, SQLite
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="echotask-preview">Interface preview in development.</p>

      <p class="echotask-pause">
        Development is currently paused while the portfolio rebuild is the priority.
      </p>

      <a class="action action-secondary echotask-action" href="https://github.com/haneyoshi/WebAppMVP">
        View EchoTask on GitHub
      </a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section id="experience" class="experience-education container" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <p class="section-label">03 / Background</p>
    <h2 id="experience-title">Experience and Education</h2>

    <div class="experience-education-pair">
      <article class="experience-education-entry">
        <h3>Experience</h3>
        <h4>IT Operations Analyst</h4>
        <p class="experience-education-metadata">June 2025–Present</p>
        <p>
          Current technical role involving IT operations, data reporting, workflow analysis,
          automation, and technical problem-solving.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-education-entry">
        <h3>Education</h3>
        <h4>Bachelor’s degree in Applied Computer Science</h4>
        <p class="experience-education-metadata">University of Winnipeg · Completed 2023</p>
        <p>
          The degree established a foundation in software development, computing concepts, and
          structured problem-solving.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills" class="skills container" aria-labelledby="skills-title">
    <div class="skills-heading">
      <p class="section-label">04 / Capabilities</p>
      <h2 id="skills-title">Skills</h2>
      <p>
        Skills are presented in evidence-based groups rather than as an exhaustive technology list.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-grid">
      <article class="skill-evidence">
        <h3>Software development</h3>
        <p>Python and MySQL were used to develop the MediCheck educational desktop software prototype.</p>
        <p>
          JavaScript, React, and Flask support the EchoTask full-stack MVP, while Astro and
          TypeScript support this portfolio rebuild.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="skill-evidence">
        <h3>Data and relational systems</h3>
        <p>MediCheck demonstrates relational database design and SQL-based information retrieval.</p>
        <p>EchoTask uses SQLAlchemy and SQLite for relational data modeling and persistence work.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="skill-evidence">
        <h3>Workflow analysis and automation</h3>
        <p>
          My current role provides experience in analyzing workflows and developing small
          automation tools.
        </p>
        <p>
          EchoTask demonstrates how I translate operational workflow ideas into data structures and
          application responsibilities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="skill-evidence">
        <h3>Technical operations and problem-solving</h3>
        <p>
          My IT Operations Analyst experience and Bachelor’s degree in Applied Computer Science
          support a practical approach to technical problem-solving.
        </p>
        <p>
          Independent software projects and the iterative rebuild of this portfolio provide further
          evidence of that approach.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-major);
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .experience-education,
  .skills {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .about {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-major);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .about h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-section);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .about-introduction {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .about-supporting {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .about-supporting p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-supporting p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .projects {
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-section);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 100vmax var(--color-surface);
    clip-path: inset(0 -100vmax);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .projects-heading {
    max-width: 52ch;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .projects h2,
  .projects h3,
  .projects h4 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .projects h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .projects-introduction {
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .medicheck {
    margin-top: var(--space-section);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .medicheck-header {
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-lg);
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .medicheck-header,
  .medicheck-summary,
  .medicheck-details {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .medicheck h3 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .project-metadata {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .project-metadata span {
    margin-inline: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .medicheck-summary {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .medicheck-summary p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-technology {
    margin-top: var(--space-md) !important;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .medicheck-figure {
    max-width: 43.75rem;
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0 0;
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .medicheck-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .medicheck-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .medicheck-details {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .medicheck-details section + section {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .medicheck-details h4 {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .medicheck-details p {
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .medicheck-action {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .echotask {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-major);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .echotask h3 {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .echotask-content {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .echotask-content p,
  .echotask-pause {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .echotask-content p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .echotask-preview {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 0;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .echotask-pause {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .echotask-action {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .experience-education {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .experience-education h2,
  .experience-education h3,
  .experience-education h4 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .experience-education h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-section);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .experience-education-pair {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .experience-education-entry {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
  }

  .experience-education-entry h3 {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .experience-education-entry h4 {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .experience-education-metadata {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .experience-education-entry > p:last-child {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .skills {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .skills-heading {
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .skills h2,
  .skills h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .skills h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-section);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .skills-heading p {
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .skill-evidence {
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .skill-evidence h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .skill-evidence p {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-display);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .hero-summary {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .hero-contact {
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .hero-contact ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm) 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .hero-contact a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-inline: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .hero-contact li:first-child a {
    padding-inline-start: 0;
  }

  .hero-contact li + li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-contact li + li::before {
    width: 1px;
    height: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-border);
    content: '';
  }

  .hero-contact a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .hero-contact a:active {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-active);
    color: var(--color-accent-active);
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  .action {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .action-primary {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .action-primary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .action-primary:active {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-active);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent-active);
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  .action-secondary {
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .action-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .action-secondary:active {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-active);
    color: var(--color-accent-active);
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 23rem) {
    .echotask {
      padding: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .experience-education-pair {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .medicheck {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
      grid-template-areas:
        'header header'
        'summary figure'
        'details figure'
        'action figure';
      column-gap: var(--space-2xl);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .medicheck-header {
      grid-area: header;
    }

    .medicheck-summary {
      grid-area: summary;
    }

    .medicheck-figure {
      grid-area: figure;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: var(--space-xl);
      justify-self: end;
    }

    .medicheck-details {
      grid-area: details;
    }

    .medicheck-action {
      grid-area: action;
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
